README.md
============================================================
# SimPeripherals

Generated by [CIaC](https://github.com/jrcalgo/ciac) — do not edit the
compiler-owned wiring by hand; regenerate it from the `.ciac` source
instead. Business logic lives in `src/services/`, which is yours.

## Run

```sh
cargo run
```

Or bring up the full stack (API, Redis):

```sh
docker compose up --build
```

## Layout

| Path | Purpose | Owner |
|------|---------|-------|
| `src/main.rs` | Application assembly | compiler |
| `src/routes/` | HTTP routers (one per api) | compiler |
| `src/services/` | Business-logic handlers | **you** |
| `src/workers/` | Queue consumers and scheduled jobs | compiler |
| `src/config.rs` | Environment-driven settings | compiler |

Requests to protected routes need a bearer token signed with
`JWT_SECRET` (default `change-me`, algorithm HS256).
============================================================
docker-compose.yml
============================================================
services:
  app:
    build: .
    ports:
      - "8000:8000"
    healthcheck:
      test: ["CMD", "bash", "-c", "exec 3<>/dev/tcp/127.0.0.1/8000"]
      interval: 1s
      timeout: 3s
      retries: 30
    environment:
      REDIS_URL: redis://cache:6379/0
      S3_ENDPOINT: http://minio:9000
      SMTP_HOST: mailpit
      SEARCH_URL: http://search:9200
      JWT_SECRET: ${JWT_SECRET:-change-me}
    depends_on:
      cache:
        condition: service_healthy
      minio:
        condition: service_started
      mailpit:
        condition: service_started
      search:
        condition: service_started

  cache:
    image: redis:7
    ports:
      - "6379:6379"
    healthcheck:
      test: ["CMD", "redis-cli", "ping"]
      interval: 2s
      timeout: 3s
      retries: 20

  minio:
    image: minio/minio
    command: ["server", "/data"]
    environment:
      MINIO_ROOT_USER: minioadmin
      MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD: minioadmin
    volumes:
      - minio-data:/data

  mailpit:
    image: axllent/mailpit
    ports:
      - "8025:8025"

  search:
    image: opensearchproject/opensearch:2
    environment:
      discovery.type: single-node
      DISABLE_SECURITY_PLUGIN: "true"

volumes:
  minio-data:
